{{!
    @template tool_vae/next_actions

    The banner "Ce que je peux faire maintenant" (lot S2): its title, then the buttons of the vaeiste, or the lines of the
    manager, or a plain sentence when nothing is flagged.

    Every text comes from the context, already worded by tool_vae\output\next_actions (singular or plural included).
    The banner gives no total, no percentage and no colour of success.

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * title - string, the title of the banner
    * none - false, or a string: the sentence shown when nothing is flagged
    * hasbuttons - bool, true when the buttons of the vaeiste are shown
    * buttons - array of objects {url, label}: the actions of the vaeiste
    * haslines - bool, true when the lines of the manager are shown
    * lines - array of objects {url, label}: the lines of the manager, each with its number in its label
    * note - string, the sentence below the lines of the manager

    Example context (json):
    {
        "title": "What you can do now",
        "none": false,
        "hasbuttons": true,
        "buttons": [
            {"url": "https://example.com/admin/tool/vae/declare.php", "label": "Declare an activity"},
            {"url": "https://example.com/admin/tool/vae/dossier.php?userid=7", "label": "Answer the requests for precision (3)"}
        ],
        "haslines": true,
        "lines": [
            {"url": "https://example.com/admin/tool/vae/candidates.php", "label": "12 declarations to attest"},
            {"url": "https://example.com/admin/tool/vae/deposit.php?userid=9", "label": "1 deposit without an opinion"}
        ],
        "note": "These numbers count all the vaeistes you follow, whatever the block chosen."
    }
}}
<div class="tool-vae-next">
    <h3 class="h5">{{title}}</h3>
    {{#none}}
    <p class="mb-0">{{none}}</p>
    {{/none}}
    {{#hasbuttons}}
    <div>{{#buttons}}<a class="btn btn-secondary me-2 mb-2" href="{{url}}">{{label}}</a>{{/buttons}}</div>
    {{/hasbuttons}}
    {{#haslines}}
    <ul class="mb-1">
        {{#lines}}
        <li><a href="{{url}}">{{label}}</a></li>
        {{/lines}}
    </ul>
    <p class="mb-0 small text-muted">{{note}}</p>
    {{/haslines}}
</div>
